Files included (unmodified from the upstream repository):
  - edge_sam_3x_encoder.onnx
  - edge_sam_3x_decoder.onnx

Changes made:
  - No modification was made to the file contents. Only the ONNX weight files (not the
    app.py/handler.py/requirements.txt also published in that repository) actually
    loaded by this application were selected and copied verbatim into
    public/models/edge-sam/ so that smart-object-select can serve the model from its
    own origin instead of fetching it from the Hugging Face Hub at runtime.

